      },
      "message": "fix(fidelity): name both remedies while the cause is not recorded\n\nA model can have reduced accuracy for two causes: the STEP facet budget\n(#1054) and edges that lie off their surfaces (#2976). The document does\nnot record which, so the refusal of a coarse model, the MCP note, the\nrefusal of a kind that cannot read the excess, the vouch refusal, the\nmodel-page hint and the import_model tool description now name both\nremedies. #2996 adds the record; then each text names the one cause.\n\nRefs #2996\nRefs #2976\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
